      "parameters": {
        "content": "### ManyChat External Request\nPOST to `/webhook/manychat-comment` with header `X-Eki-Webhook-Secret` and body `{ \"name\": \"{{first_name}}\", \"username\": \"{{ig_username}}\", \"keyword\": \"{{last_input_text}}\" }`.\nThe workflow REPLIES with a ManyChat dynamic-block (v2) message, so ManyChat sends the DM itself (no ManyChat API key needed here). Keywords: VENDOR / SELL / INFO / JOIN -> vendor, BUY -> buyer.\nOptional `WHATSAPP_CTA_LINK` (your wa.me click-to-chat link).",
